## Original Content
Yeezy was slated to perform a pair of shows at Gazprom Arena in October.

## Summary
Kanye West's (Yeezy) scheduled concerts at Gazprom Arena in Russia for October have been canceled. The cancellation is due to the venue stating no rental agreement was ever signed. This development leaves the shows' status unresolved.

## Key Points
- Yeezy (Kanye West) had two shows scheduled at Gazprom Arena in October.
- The venue, Gazprom Arena, cited no signed rental agreement as the reason for cancellation.
- The cancellation leaves the future of the scheduled performances uncertain.


